{{ ref: a8ed1f5f-d858-49eb-a1bf-0870615cbe76 }}
- **Scope**: `crates/core/src/pack.rs`. Consumes folder-level clusters (commit 4) and per-SCC break sets (commit 3); produces file assignments under the 250-production-SLOC cap.
--{ ref: a8ed1f5f-d858-49eb-a1bf-0870615cbe76 }--
{{ ref: 9a153f20-40ed-472b-8f3c-7e5efc0230d5 }}
- **Description**: Cohesion-first packing — files are not bins. Oversized acyclic groups split at the cheapest legal point; oversized cyclic groups are never split illegally and instead emit a conditional split whose preconditions are the MFAS break suggestions (AD-1). Single symbols over the cap get a flagged exemption.
--{ ref: 9a153f20-40ed-472b-8f3c-7e5efc0230d5 }--

